{
  "about": [
    "Graded boots: the game's own boot legs (player-parts/boots-leg-front.webp and -back.webp) recoloured per piece by scripts/art/import-grade-boots.mjs.",
    "fill repaints the boot's leather keeping its light and dark; details are painted on in that order as the grade rises:",
    "cuff (trim colour across the top), sheen (a light edge), sole (strap colour across the bottom), strap and strap2 (bands),",
    "studs (light dots on the straps), gem (the jewel on the cuff), glow (the outline tinted with the fill).",
    "r10 is the same pair with gold trim, straps and studs (a gold cuff and strap where the grade has none);",
    "r20 is the pair in its style's jewel (emerald Ranger, sapphire Warrior, ruby Mystic), shaded by grade, with the gold of r10.",
    "Each piece also gets a bag icon: both legs side by side, four times the size."
  ],
